  {
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "Thanks for the report. Looks like the found TBB version is too old:\r\n```\r\n    numba/np/ufunc/tbbpool.cpp:30:2: error: #error \"TBB version is too old, 2019 update 5, i.e. TBB_INTERFACE_VERSION >= 11005 required\"\r\n     #error \"TBB version is too old, 2019 update 5, i.e. TBB_INTERFACE_VERSION >= 11005 required\"\r\n```\r\nhttps://github.com/numba/numba/pull/5821 (should be in next release) will offer an option to disable it, another option is to get a newer version of TBB.\r\n\r\nAlso, an installation method that works for a Jetson TX2 is described here: http://numba.pydata.org/numba-doc/latest/user/installing.html#installing-on-linux-armv8-aarch64-platforms\r\n\r\nHope this helps?",
